    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281230/extras/bf9b0459ca7379cc18ef608b304620a6.avif?t=1730755359\" width=616 height=838 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anthology of Stories</strong>: Experience completely different narratives in each chapter, with each tale introducing new characters, locations, and themes. Begin your journey with <i>Strange Lovebirds</i>, a haunting love story gone wrong.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ongoing Content</strong>: New chapters will be released as DLCs, each one a fresh and terrifying narrative, expanding the unsettling universe of <i>Tales of the Uncanny</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Horror</strong>: Immerse yourself in meticulously crafted environments where every shadow, sound, and silence deepens the sense of dread.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Exploration</strong>: Investigate eerie environments, uncover clues, and interact with objects as you piece together the chilling stories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Tension</strong>: Face the unknown as tension builds through the twisted stories, playing on fears of the mind and the darkness hidden in human nature.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choice-Driven Outcomes</strong>: Your choices affect how the story unfolds, giving you control over your path but never truly knowing what consequences await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281230/extras/a96dc7815d0b524d85bb29009f5e437d.avif?t=1730755359\" width=616 height=526 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Are you ready to embrace the uncanny and step into the unknown?</i></strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281230/extras/bf9b0459ca7379cc18ef608b304620a6.avif?t=1730755359\" width=616 height=838 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anthology of Stories</strong>: Experience completely different narratives in each chapter, with each tale introducing new characters, locations, and themes. Begin your journey with <i>Strange Lovebirds</i>, a haunting love story gone wrong.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ongoing Content</strong>: New chapters will be released as DLCs, each one a fresh and terrifying narrative, expanding the unsettling universe of <i>Tales of the Uncanny</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Horror</strong>: Immerse yourself in meticulously crafted environments where every shadow, sound, and silence deepens the sense of dread.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Exploration</strong>: Investigate eerie environments, uncover clues, and interact with objects as you piece together the chilling stories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Tension</strong>: Face the unknown as tension builds through the twisted stories, playing on fears of the mind and the darkness hidden in human nature.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choice-Driven Outcomes</strong>: Your choices affect how the story unfolds, giving you control over your path but never truly knowing what consequences await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281230/extras/a96dc7815d0b524d85bb29009f5e437d.avif?t=1730755359\" width=616 height=526 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Are you ready to embrace the uncanny and step into the unknown?</i></strong></p>",
